ce is  clearly required to sift through and  integrate  these multiple different data types and  i i hope that some of our uh  participants in our foundation or our  sorry a biomedical  data science innovation lab activities  will look to this as a potential  uh project idea um anyway  thank you very much kevin very much  appreciate it  thank you everybody who tuned in and uh  we'll look forward to seeing you next  week  thanks so much enjoy your weekend okay  thank you


